      "x": 0,
      "y": 8800
    },
    "todo": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 1200,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "TODO\n\n1. Учёт для животных: кошки, собаки и другие.\n2. Рисунок животного или человека. (Силуэты кошки и собаки — экраны 17–18.)\n3. Тёмная тема. (Сделано: палитра — 19, тёмные версии всех экранов — 20–25, 28–39; при правке экрана обновлять и его Dark-копии.)\n4. Английский язык. (Сделано: страница English на холсте; при правке экрана обновлять и его En-копии.)\n5. Вносить и отслеживать срок годности лекарств. (Макет: экраны 40–43 — список сроков, вскрытые, прогноз «успеете ли», ввод кодом, фото или вручную. Дальше: срок после вскрытия для капель и сиропов — в справочник.)\n6. Базовые правила уколов в мышцу и подкожно — чтобы напоминать и контролировать процесс. (Макет: экраны 44–49 — укол пошагово с проверками и отсчётом, памятка. Для питомцев — свои правила, позже.)\n7. Собрать рецепт как шаблон.\n8. Офлайн-распознавание: справочник ГРЛС внутри приложения, распознавание фото и речи на телефоне (кириллица), исправление по словарю.\n9. Расширить правила разбора: числа словами, дроби и диапазоны, точное время, «1т × 3р», ампулы, латинские сокращения, «по схеме».\n10. Почерк: фото подложкой + построчный ввод или диктовка с подсказками из справочника.\n11. Сканер: таблица «код товара → лекарство» — найти источник.\n12. Близкие без интернета: SMS о пропуске и передача по QR. Проверить: на iPhone SMS только с нажатием, на Android — разрешение на SMS в Google Play.\n13. Позже, по желанию: языковая модель на телефоне отдельным пакетом.\n14. Давление: приём с тонометров по Bluetooth (профиль Blood Pressure), распознавание экрана тонометра по фото, напоминания утром и вечером.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 2860,
      "y": 0
    },
    "n26": {
      "text": "Своя цифровая клавиатура: поля переключаются сами (128 → 82 → 71), ⌫ на пустом поле возвращает назад. Серия из двух замеров, среднее. Оценка — относительно цели врача. Ещё способы: фото тонометра, голос, Bluetooth — всё без интернета.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12004
    },
    "n27": {
      "text": "Средние утром и вечером, график по дням с линиями цели, подсказка, последние замеры словами и цветом. Замеры идут в PDF-отчёт врачу.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 12260
    },
    "n28": {
      "text": "Тот же экран в тёмной теме.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 12004
    },
    "n29": {
      "text": "Тот же экран в тёмной теме.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 12260
    },
    "title6": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 1800,
      "text": "Давление",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10800
    },
    "title_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2740,
      "text": "Ampulse — pill and injection tracker",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title2_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 1330,
      "text": "Prescription → ready plan",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1960,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title3_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3210,
      "text": "Schedules, family, scanner, safety",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4700,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title4_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 860,
      "text": "Pets",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6980,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title5_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 3210,
      "text": "Dark theme",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8800,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title6_en": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 1800,
      "text": "Blood pressure",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10800,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n1_en": {
      "text": "The day as a timeline. One tap marks a dose, overdue ones are highlighted, the ring shows the day’s progress.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n2_en": {
      "text": "For important medicines — a full-screen reminder: repeats after 10 minutes, then a text to a family member. Skips are logged with a reason for the doctor.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n3_en": {
      "text": "Injection site rotation: the number is days since the last injection, the app suggests the site that has rested longest. Dose and sugar right here.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n4_en": {
      "text": "All on one screen, filled from the on-device directory. You see right away whether the pack lasts the course. Prescription import is at the top.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 1372,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n5_en": {
      "text": "Supply is counted from the schedule: “lasts N days”. Supplies (needles) and expiry dates too.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n6_en": {
      "text": "Adherence calendar, a tip about frequent misses and a PDF report for the doctor.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 1250,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n7_en": {
      "text": "Text, prescription photo, voice or file — all recognized on the phone, offline. You can forward the doctor’s message via Share. Parsing is live — edit the text in Play.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3164,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n8_en": {
      "text": "Each line becomes a card. Solid border — taken from the text, dashed — guessed. Missing details are asked. A match with a current medicine shows as a dose change.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 3880,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n9_en": {
      "text": "What, when, where and how much: fitted to the daily routine, injection sites, course dates and how much to buy. The app never changes doses.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 4020,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n10_en": {
      "text": "Stepped tapering and increasing, cycles, weekly, alternating, as needed and pause. A reminder the day before each dose change.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6140,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n11_en": {
      "text": "A timer to the next allowed dose and a 24-hour counter. Sooner than the interval — only after confirming, over the limit — not allowed.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 5904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n12_en": {
      "text": "Anna’s phone: a copy of Mom’s schedule (sent by QR when together) and texts about misses. Offline: no text means the dose was marked.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 6180,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n13_en": {
      "text": "Mom decides what goes to Anna by text and what is shared by QR. The doctor gets a PDF report instead of a link.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 6360,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n14_en": {
      "text": "Offline, the Chestny Znak code gives the expiry, batch and pack number; the name comes from the on-device directory. Scanning the same pack again won’t double the supply.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 5904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n15_en": {
      "text": "If a dose is already marked, we stop you. An extra dose can be recorded for the doctor.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 5904,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n16_en": {
      "text": "Allergies, conditions, medicines and last-dose times — on the lock screen. A text to Anna with location if the card is opened. The QR holds the card itself.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 6240,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n17_en": {
      "text": "Cat silhouette, side view. The left/right switch mirrors the drawing; the scruff is shared. The number is days since an injection; the longest-rested site is suggested.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8184,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n18_en": {
      "text": "The same screen for a dog: its own silhouette and sites. Pets switch at the top, weight is in the subtitle.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 8184,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n19_en": {
      "text": "The dark theme palette. Every screen has a dark version: 20–25, 28–29 and 30–39, and links between them stay dark. Reminder (2) and scanner (14) are dark in any theme.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 10160,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n26_en": {
      "text": "A custom keypad: fields advance by themselves (128 → 82 → 71), ⌫ on an empty field goes back. A series of two readings and their average. Judged against the doctor’s target. Also: monitor photo, voice, Bluetooth — all offline.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12004,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n27_en": {
      "text": "Morning and evening averages, a daily chart with target lines, a tip, latest readings in words and color. Readings go into the doctor’s PDF report.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 470,
      "y": 12260,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n28_en": {
      "text": "The same screen in the dark theme.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 12004,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "n29_en": {
      "text": "The same screen in the dark theme.",
      "w": 390,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 12260,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "offline_en": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 520,
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Mode: fully offline\n\nRecognition — on the phone: rules, medicine directory, photo and speech.\nFamily — texts about misses and QR when together.\nDoctor — a PDF report.\nScanner — expiry, batch and number from the code; authenticity and recalls can’t be checked offline.",
      "w": 440,
      "x": 3380,
      "y": 0,
      "page": "en"
    },
    "title7": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 4620,
      "text": "Тёмная тема — остальные экраны",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
